    {
      "id": "claim_6856bf628cf1430fa1e854683fbfcc3b",
      "statement": "The auto-response short circuit: a matched text frame is answered in the shell and never becomes a webSocketMessage — no routing, no activity, no wake — so a hibernated cell stays hibernated.",
